# Spirit Mascot: "Whenever one or more cards leave your graveyard, put a +1/+1 counter on this creature." On turn 1 Bot1 casts the
# Mascot and Faithless Looting, discarding two Plains: three cards went into the graveyard and none left it, so it is still
# 2/2 on turn 2. On turn 3 it flashes Looting back (the card leaves the graveyard) and the Mascot gets one counter, once.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Spirit Mascot
Faithless Looting
Mountain
Plains
Plains
Plains x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

